m-devbox — a portable, container-delivered M development environment: one
pinned image carrying YottaDB, the five native m-stdlib callouts, the `m` /
`m-ydb` toolchain, the M and FileMan Standard Libraries, standalone VA FileMan,
and a browser-served VS Code (code-server) with four extensions.

